  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CUTS Int activities develop countries in WTO negotiations on fisheries subsidies</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CUTS Int aktiviteter underl&#xe4;ttar utv l&#xe4;ndernas delt WTO-f&#xf6;rhandlingar fiskesub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Identifiera de huvudsakliga fr&#xe5;gor som &#xe4;r av betydelse n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller WTOs discipliner inom fiske subventioner i de utvalda minst utvecklade l&#xe4;nderna. Syftet &#xe4;r att bidra till en utvecklings v&#xe4;nlig f&#xf6;rhandling i denna fr&#xe5;ga genom ekonomiska, milj&#xf6;m&#xe4;ssiga och sociala utvecklings dimensioner f&#xf6;r LDSs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identity the main issues of importance with regards to WTO fisheries subsidies disciplines, in respect of selected LDCs. The aim is to make a contribution to development-friendly negotiations on this issue which has economic, environmental and social development dimensions for the LDSs.</narrative>
  </description>
